<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38381" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαυξ-άνω</span></b>  (<i><span class="en">
			Pl.
			<u>Ti.</u>
			19a
		</span></i> (
			Pass.
		), <i><span class="en">
			D.
			3.33
		</span></i>, etc.) or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαυξ-αύξω</span></b> 
			(<i><span class="en">
			X.
			<u>Oec.</u>
			7.43
		</span></i> (
			Pass.
		), <i><span class="en">
			<u>OGI</u>
			90.38
		</span></i> (Rosetta, <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>)): fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-αυξήσω</span>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>increase, enlarge,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Emp.
				17.32
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν πατρίδα νικήσαντας ἐπαυξῆσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					7.70
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.36
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i> l. c.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰμ βασιλείαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					629.5
				</span></i>
			 (Delph., <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν ἔρανον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>).<i><span class="en">
				155 iii 84
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Rhodes</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν
				φιλαγαθίαν</span> ib. <i><span class="en">
				12(7).232.6
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Amorgos</span>):— 
			
				Pass.
			, <i>grow, increase,</i> X.l.c., Pl.l.c., etc.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr., <i>grow,
				increase,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aristaenet.
				1.16
			</span></i>.</div>
